# Extracted from windows-version/patches/rexglue-local-changes.patch,
# also present on main (original project commit 4ee3aee).
# Only control-flow codegen; excludes GPR/LR inlining and all GPU changes.
# Apply to sdk-src/, never to the downloaded ReXGlue/ SDK.

